/* Allow-all capture policy.

   Authorizes every action and never denies. Used by the
   translation loop to record natural (unblocked) agent traces:
   pin it per session via SASY_POLICY_PATH (or
   sasy.session(policy=...)) with SASY_CAPTURE_FILE set, then
   convert the captured decision points into test scenarios with
   experiments/translation/capture_to_scenarios.py.

   NOT for production use. */
#include "../../sasy/souffle/common_policy.dl"

IsAuthorized(idx) :- Actions(idx, _).
